aura (1.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Tooling & ecosystem: aura.toml projects (aura init / build / test with
    [run] defaults), interactive REPL, token-safe formatter (aura fmt),
    linter (aura lint: unused locals, unreachable code, empty catch),
    Markdown doc generator from /// comments (aura doc), watch mode
    (aura run --watch), and timing/JIT stats (aura run --stats).
  * aura build emits binary bytecode modules (.aurac) that aura run
    executes directly.

 -- Aura Contributors <charxard1332@icloud.com>  Wed, 19 Aug 2026 13:30:00 -0500

aura (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First release. Linux packaged as .deb (this package), Windows x64 as MSI.
  * Full toolchain: compiler, bytecode VM with generational GC (opt-in
    concurrent collector), tiered x86-64 JIT, source-level debugger and DAP
    adapter, 74 example programs.

 -- Aura Contributors <charxard1332@icloud.com>  Wed, 19 Aug 2026 11:59:00 -0500
